==Tailoring==
Wood is used in the spool of the [[2 Willow Lane#Sewing Machine|Sewing Machine]] with [[Cloth]] in the feed to create a dyeable [[Tailoring|Basic Pullover]].
*Male version: [[File:Shirt176.png|24px]]
*Female version: [[File:Shirt177.png|24px]]
It is a brown dye when used in the spool of the Sewing Machine with a dyeable clothing item in the feed. It can be placed in the orange dye pot at [[Emily]]'s and [[Haley]]'s house for use in [[dyeing]].

==Quests==
*Robin may ask the player to gather 1000 pieces of wood within one week in the [[Quests#Robin's Resource Rush|"Robin's Resource Rush"]] special order. The player may keep the harvested wood. If completed on time, Robin will mail the farmer the recipe to create a [[Stone Chest]].

==History==
{{History|1.3.27|Increased price of wood at [[Carpenter's Shop]] from {{Price|10}} in Year 1 to {{Price|50}} in Year 2+. Added [[Wood Sign]] recipe.}}
{{History|1.4|The [[Foraging#Foraging Skill|Forester Profession]] no longer increases the sale price of Wood. Added [[Deluxe Scarecrow]] and [[Tea Sapling]] recipes. Can now be used in [[Tailoring]]. Can be produced by [[Fish Pond]]s and [[Wood Chipper]]s.}}
{{History|1.5|Used as an ingredient to the [[Cookout Kit]] recipe.}}
{{History|1.6|Used as an ingredient to the [[Dehydrator]], [[Text Sign]], and [[Big Chest]] recipes. Reading [[Woody's Secret]] has a chance to double wood output from trees. Can now be purchased at [[Desert Festival]] and traded from the [[Bookseller]]. No longer used for building Plank Cabin and Log Cabin.}}

